OL,3,GNEWSASeventeen rescued after fishing
OL,4,Aboat runs aground off Orkney
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major rescue operation has taken
OL,7,Fplace in Orkney after a fishing boat
OL,8,Fran aground close to the Old Man Of
OL,9,FHoy.
OL,11,FThe Genesis fishing boat struck rocks
OL,12,Foff the west coast of the island of Hoy
OL,13,Fand issued a mayday call at about
OL,14,F06:30.
OL,16,FThe RNLI lifeboat from Stromness was
OL,17,Finvolved in the rescue, along with
OL,18,Fcoastguard helicopters from Sumburgh
OL,19,Fand Stornoway, and the Northlink
OL,20,Fpassenger ferry Hamnavoe, which
OL,21,Flaunched its fast-rescue boat.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
