OL,3,GNEWSASeventeen rescued after fishing
OL,4,Aboat runs aground off Orkney
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll of the crew members were winched to
OL,7,Fsafety by a Coastguard helicopter and
OL,8,Ftaken to shore.
